abstract: >-
  A bilingual, machine-readable authorial publication comprising four
  operational non-collapse boundaries, a reflexive definition of the soul as
  freedom for open-ended self-reflection and responsibility for continued
  becoming, and the temporal premise that the future is a process rather than
  an event.
